{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10241070","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10241070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1024107001:0":{"text":"这位优雅端庄的小姐，您能告诉我一些关于黑鸭的可贵情报吗？","source_cn":"这位优雅端庄的小姐，您能告诉我一些关于黑鸭的可贵情报吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF75268C58D22078","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1024107002:0":{"text":"呀~小哥真是客气！","source_cn":"呀~小哥真是客气！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE5BC82F42E9F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1024107003:0":{"text":"那只该死的——咳嗯，奇怪的黑鸭子，总是在我的鹅圈外踱步。","source_cn":"那只该死的——咳嗯，奇怪的黑鸭子，总是在我的鹅圈外踱步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA11E7E1EFF681BA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1024107004:0":{"text":"昨天晚上，它对着鹅群叫了几声，然后我含辛茹苦养大的白鹅们就纷纷张开翅膀，飞走了！","source_cn":"昨天晚上，它对着鹅群叫了几声，然后我含辛茹苦养大的白鹅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4445628EEC226C6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1024107005:0":{"text":"不只是我，<style=\"highlight\">秘银商会的人</style>也见到了！","source_cn":"不只是我，<style=highlight>秘银商会的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24AE04F47D1ACF3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_f